{"at":"2026-02-18T16:02:09.515Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":585,"status":"published","language":"es","path":"/es/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/","title":"Contacts","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tMLS User Manual\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Contacts</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstimated reading: 1 minute\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t1007 views\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10273\" class=\"elementor elementor-10273\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43caf1b9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"43caf1b9\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-60ee5cd6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"60ee5cd6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Stay organised and close more deals!</strong> PropertyList&#8217;s powerful contact management system lets you centralise your client information, link properties, documents, notes, and events and create property alerts – all in one place. This ensures you have everything you need at your fingertips for a smooth and successful sales process.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:144\"><strong>Stay in the loop with complete contact history!</strong></p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:144\">Each contact provides a dedicated timeline, giving you a clear view of:</p>\n<ul data-sourcepos=\"5:1-7:0\">\n<li data-sourcepos=\"5:1-5:89\"><strong>All communication:</strong> See every email sent and received, along with any links shared etc.</li>\n<li data-sourcepos=\"6:1-7:0\"><strong>Detailed history:</strong> Track changes made to contact information, with timestamps and usernames for complete transparency.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"8:1-8:99\">This comprehensive timeline empowers you to stay informed and build stronger client relationships.</p>\n<p data-sourcepos=\"13:1-13:146\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-10180 size-full\" src=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive.jpg\" alt=\"PropertyList\" width=\"1734\" height=\"671\" srcset=\"https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive.jpg 1734w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-300x116.jpg 300w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-1024x396.jpg 1024w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-768x297.jpg 768w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-20x8.jpg 20w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-32x12.jpg 32w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-1536x594.jpg 1536w, https://info-staging.propertylist.es/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/Screenshot_20231212_115722_Drive-600x232.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1734px) 100vw, 1734px\" /></p>\n<p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"details_cont ent recently_added\" id=\"content_elements\"><h4 class=\"c_head\">Articles</h4><ul class=\"article_list\"><li class=\"page_item page-item-10274\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/adding-a-contact/\">Adding a contact</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10275\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/link-properties-to-contact/\">Link/add properties to a contact</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10277\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/link-documents-to-a-contact/\">Link/add documents to a contact</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10276\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/assign-contact-to-an-agent/\">Assign contact to an agent</a></li>\n<li class=\"page_item page-item-10278\"><a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/how-to-use-contacts/add-professional-contacts-to-a-contact/\">Add professional contacts to a contact</a></li>\n</ul></div>\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager first\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/requests/\">\r\n                    <span> MLS User Manual - Previous </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tReQuests                </a>\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/documents/\">\r\n                    <span> Next - MLS User Manual </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tDocuments                </a>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n    </article>","seo_title":"Contacts • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}